---
description: Publish completed Offline Translator updates automatically
alwaysApply: true
---

The maintainer authorizes routine app updates to be pushed and deployed as part of completing the requested work.
After appropriate validation, commit the requested changes and push main to the existing freeappstore-online/offline-translator repository.
Monitor the deployment and verify the public app before reporting completion.
A separate request to push is unnecessary. Honor explicit local-only, draft, pause, or deferred decisions.
Keep credentials, local environment files and translation history out of commits.
